add('32-create-story','Create or edit a story','Writer studio',header('Start with a story.','Give readers a title, a little context, and a reason to turn the page.','New story')+storyform,'Title, synopsis, genre, language, format, status, tags and content rating are required design fields. Artwork is a genuine upload control. Mature content requires the correct tag and content warnings.','studio','My stories')
