editor='<header class="editortop"><div class="row">'+ic('arrow-left')+'<div class="editorbook"><strong style="font-size:13px">Spring Under the Bridge</strong><small style="display:block">Chapter 9 · Draft</small></div><span class="mobile-only tiny">Chapter 9 · Draft</span></div><div class="actions"><span class="tiny muted desktop-only">'+ic('check')+' All changes saved</span>'+btn('Preview','small')+btn('Publish','primary small','arrow-right')+'</div></header><div class="editorlayout"><aside class="editorside"><div class="eyebrow">Your manuscript</div><h3 class="serif">Chapters</h3>'+chapters(8,10)+'</aside><main class="editorcenter"><div class="formatbar"><span>Paragraph '+ic('chevron-down')+'</span>'+''.join(ic(i) for i in ['bold','italic','underline','list','quote','link','undo-2','redo-2'])+'</div><article class="editorpaper"><div class="eyebrow">Chapter 9 · 1,248 words</div><h1>Things left unsaid</h1>'+''.join(f'<p>{t}</p>' for t in PROSE[1:])+ '<p>By morning, she would have to choose.<span class="cursor"></span></p><div class="rule"></div><p class="hint" style="font-family:Rubik;font-size:11px">Private draft · Last saved just now</p></article></main><aside class="editorright"><h3>Chapter details</h3><div style="margin-top:25px">'+field('Author note','A small turning point.',area=True)+field('Content warnings','None '+ic('chevron-down'))+'</div><div class="rule"></div><h3>Private writing notes</h3><p>Hana should notice the envelope before Ren says anything. Keep the ending unresolved.</p><p class="safe">These notes are not shown to readers.</p><div class="rule"></div><h3>Revision history</h3><p>Saved today, 12:14 am<br>Saved yesterday, 11:52 pm</p>'+btn('View revisions','plain small')+'</aside></div>'
